    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d385-f1" n="2" xml:id="d385-f1-content">
                <p>During its 97th Meeting on July 18, the National Security Council agreed to amend
                    Appendix 2 to NSC 111 by removing Canada from its list of countries receiving
                    United States economic or financial assistance. The Council determined that the
                    Export-Import Bank loan under review was made in connection with operations in
                    which the United States had practically the entire interest, thereby resulting
                    in the conclusion that Canada did not receive assistance as contemplated by
                    Section 1302. (Memorandum by Executive Secretary Lay, July 18, S/S–NSC Files,
                    Lot 63 D 351, NSC 111–Kem Amendments.)</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
